<title>HUNGARY: Hungary to issue 10,000 HUF banknote from July 1.</title>
<headline>Hungary to issue 10,000 HUF banknote from July 1.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary will increase the maximum nominal value of its banknotes but the new 10,000 forint note, to be issued from July 1, will not increase the amount of money in circulation, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The amount of money in circulation has almost doubled since 1991, when the current largest 5,000 forint note was issued, the National Bank of Hungary said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
